	(text "DUAL-PORT VIDEO RAM AND THE 6845" (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.5 2.5) (bold yes)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a4db2eb2-6c95-5277-92f0-1fefc8d9e9f5"))
	(text "The IDT7134's right port is the bus (A0-A10; its A11R is tied low, so the bus sees 2K), its left port the display:\nthe 6845's refresh address MA0-MA11 (VADDR) reads a character onto VDATA0-7 with no arbitration and no snow.\nThe 6845 also gives the row address (VROWS), HSYNC, VSYNC, display enable (DE) and the cursor. It is write-only: R/W on ground,\nE = CRTE (IC18A), high while -MRW is low, so it never drives the bus." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 15.24 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "0b898933-a014-56cc-aa4c-ac94c5f35cb2"))
	(embedded_fonts no)
)
